  "goodToKnow": "Die Abwehr is defence or resistance. In football, it's the defensive line: Die Abwehr steht gut. In medicine, die Abwehrkräfte or die körpereigene Abwehr are the body's defences: Ingwer stärkt die Abwehr. In history, die Abwehr was the German military intelligence service until 1944. Abwehren means to fend off or ward off: einen Angriff abwehren. It's related to sich wehren (to defend oneself)."
